{"seq":2,"slug":"sparse-local-attention","title":"稀疏与局部注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/extension-methods/sparse-local-attention","wordCount":1381,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"稀疏与局部注意力\">稀疏与局部注意力</h1><p>RoPE 缩放解决的是&quot;位置编码外推&quot;，但它没碰那条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的算力曲线——序列再长，每个 token 还是要看全部其他 token。稀疏与局部注意力从根上换了假设：大多数 token 其实不需要看全序列，只看一个邻域窗口加少数关键位置就够了。这一假设把复杂度从平方压回近线性，是另一条与 RoPE 缩放正交、常被叠加使用的扩展路线。本篇专讲&quot;如何通过限制可见范围压平复杂度曲线&quot;，复杂度的来源见 <a href=\"../foundations/attention-complexity\">注意力复杂度与瓶颈</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-注意力是稀疏的\">核心概念：注意力是稀疏的</h2><p>观察训练好的模型，注意力分数矩阵远非均匀——绝大多数权重集中在邻近 token 和少数特殊位置上。既然真正用到的连接稀疏，就没必要计算并存储完整的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵。各种稀疏注意力的差别，在于&quot;保留哪些连接&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[完整注意力 n×n&lt;br/&gt;O n^2] --&gt; B[只保留有用连接]&#10;  B --&gt; C[滑动窗口&lt;br/&gt;每 token 看邻域 w]&#10;  B --&gt; D[扩张/带状&lt;br/&gt;跳跃式扩大感受野]&#10;  B --&gt; E[全局 token&lt;br/&gt;少数位置看全序列]&#10;  B --&gt; F[块稀疏&lt;br/&gt;按块选择性计算]&#10;  C --&gt; G[Longformer / Mistral SWA]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  D --&gt; H[BigBird 带状+随机+全局]&#10;  F --&gt; I[Native Sparse Attention 等]\">graph TD\n  A[完整注意力 n×n&lt;br/&gt;O n^2] --&gt; B[只保留有用连接]\n  B --&gt; C[滑动窗口&lt;br/&gt;每 token 看邻域 w]\n  B --&gt; D[扩张/带状&lt;br/&gt;跳跃式扩大感受野]\n  B --&gt; E[全局 token&lt;br/&gt;少数位置看全序列]\n  B --&gt; F[块稀疏&lt;br/&gt;按块选择性计算]\n  C --&gt; G[Longformer / Mistral SWA]\n  E --&gt; G\n  D --&gt; H[BigBird 带状+随机+全局]\n  F --&gt; I[Native Sparse Attention 等]</pre><p>下表对照几种代表性模式的连接结构与复杂度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>每个 token 看谁</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>长程信息怎么传</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>滑动窗口</td>\n<td>邻近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 个</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Longformer、Mistral SWA</td>\n<td>多层堆叠间接传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带状+扩张</td>\n<td>邻域 + 跳跃位置</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>扩张注意力</td>\n<td>扩大单层感受野</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局 token</td>\n<td>少数 token 看全序列</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n + g n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>BigBird、Longformer</td>\n<td>全局 token 中转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>块稀疏</td>\n<td>选中的块</td>\n<td>近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>NSA 等</td>\n<td>块级路由</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"滑动窗口-最实用的局部注意力\">滑动窗口：最实用的局部注意力</h2><p>滑动窗口注意力（SWA）让每个 token 只关注前后各 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 个邻居，复杂度降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是常数时即线性。它最有名的工程落地是 Mistral 7B：用 4096 的滑动窗口，配合多层堆叠，让信息逐层向外扩散——第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层的某个 token 实际能间接&quot;看到&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\times w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 范围内的内容，这就是局部注意力如何不靠全连接也能传递长程信息的关键。</p>\n<p>但纯局部窗口有硬伤：远超 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\times w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 的真正长程依赖会丢失。所以实际系统很少用纯滑动窗口，而是和下面的全局 token 或与全注意力层交替使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全局-token-与混合模式\">全局 token 与混合模式</h2><p>Longformer 和 BigBird 的思路是&quot;局部为主、全局点缀&quot;：大多数 token 走滑动窗口，少数被指定的<strong>全局 token</strong>（比如分类任务里的特殊标记、或问题中的关键词）则关注整个序列、也被整个序列关注。这些全局 token 像信息枢纽，让任意两个普通 token 通过它们间接连通。BigBird 进一步加入少量随机连接，理论上证明这种&quot;带状+全局+随机&quot;的组合能逼近全注意力的表达力，复杂度却是线性。</p>\n<p>混合模式在 2024–2025 的实际架构里更常见：不少长上下文模型采用&quot;几层局部窗口 + 偶尔一层全注意力&quot;的交替结构，用绝大多数层的线性代价，换取少数全注意力层兜住全局检索——这是质量与成本之间一个被反复验证的甜点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"块稀疏与可训练稀疏\">块稀疏与可训练稀疏</h2><p>更前沿的方向是让稀疏模式本身<strong>可学习、对硬件友好</strong>。块稀疏注意力把序列切成块，在块的粒度上决定哪些块对之间需要计算注意力——块粒度天然契合 GPU 的分块计算，避免了细粒度稀疏带来的低效。2025 年出现的原生稀疏注意力（如 DeepSeek 的 Native Sparse Attention 一类工作）把这种块级路由设计成可端到端训练、且在预训练阶段就用上，而非事后打补丁，从而在长上下文上同时拿到速度与质量。这类方法代表了&quot;稀疏不再是质量妥协，而是训练时的一等公民&quot;的趋势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-rope-缩放-ssm-的关系\">与 RoPE 缩放、SSM 的关系</h2><p>要把稀疏注意力放进全 hub 的版图：它与 <a href=\"rope-scaling\">RoPE 缩放</a> 正交——一个管&quot;复杂度&quot;，一个管&quot;位置外推&quot;，现代长上下文模型常常两者同时上。它与状态空间模型则是竞争关系：SSM 用递归从架构上拿到线性复杂度且无需选连接，稀疏注意力则在保留 Transformer 全家桶的前提下逼近线性。哪条路更优至今没有定论，2026 年的不少模型干脆做混合架构，把两者拼在一起，详见跨 hub 链接。稀疏带来的另一面是：被丢弃的连接可能正是中段关键信息，这会与中间遗失叠加，见 <a href=\"../practice/context-rot-failures\">中间遗失与上下文腐烂</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>稀疏注意力的前提是&quot;注意力本就稀疏&quot;，靠限制可见范围把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压回近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>滑动窗口最实用，靠多层堆叠间接传长程信息，但纯局部会丢真正的长依赖。</li>\n<li>全局 token / 混合层用少量全连接兜住全局检索，是质量-成本的甜点。</li>\n<li>块稀疏与可训练稀疏让稀疏对硬件友好、在预训练即生效，是 2025 前沿方向。</li>\n<li>它与 RoPE 缩放正交、与 SSM 竞争；丢弃的连接可能加重中间遗失。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>复杂度的来源（前置）：<a href=\"../foundations/attention-complexity\">注意力复杂度与瓶颈</a></li>\n<li>与之正交的位置外推：<a href=\"rope-scaling\">RoPE 缩放</a></li>\n<li>稀疏丢连接带来的质量风险：<a href=\"../practice/context-rot-failures\">中间遗失与上下文腐烂</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：架构层面的线性方案与混合——<a href=\"../../state-space-models-mamba/applications/hybrid-attention-ssm\">状态空间模型与 Mamba · 注意力-SSM 混合</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"稀疏与局部注意力","id":"稀疏与局部注意力"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：注意力是稀疏的","id":"核心概念-注意力是稀疏的"},{"level":2,"text":"滑动窗口：最实用的局部注意力","id":"滑动窗口-最实用的局部注意力"},{"level":2,"text":"全局 token 与混合模式","id":"全局-token-与混合模式"},{"level":2,"text":"块稀疏与可训练稀疏","id":"块稀疏与可训练稀疏"},{"level":2,"text":"与 RoPE 缩放、SSM 的关系","id":"与-rope-缩放-ssm-的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"RoPE 缩放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/extension-methods/rope-scaling"},"next":{"title":"长度外推与微调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/long-context-llm-techniques/extension-methods/context-extension-finetuning"}}